00:00:00.020 --> 00:00:01.500
You guys know Lixian, right?

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:02.700
Lixian: I wanted death!

00:00:02.740 --> 00:00:07.340
He is the wonderful person, that has animated so many beloved animations on my channel,

00:00:07.340 --> 00:00:08.720
Animated Mark: I hate everything you stand for

00:00:08.760 --> 00:00:11.080
And he's been helping me out by editing my videos lately!

00:00:11.080 --> 00:00:12.260
Breakfast, duh!

00:00:12.260 --> 00:00:18.160
Well, he in his spare time decided to make me an entire game for my birthday

00:00:18.160 --> 00:00:23.040
And that's amazing by itself, but also it came with this lovely note:

00:00:23.220 --> 00:00:25.360
Hi Mark! I just wanted to say, thank you!

00:00:25.360 --> 00:00:28.800
Thank you for everything. You've completely changed my life for the better!

00:00:28.800 --> 00:00:34.780
You gave me so many opportunities, and I am so grateful and happy to be working alongside such an incredible person!

00:00:34.780 --> 00:00:39.440
I wanted to show my appreciation for you and I feel like I don't do that enough.

00:00:39.440 --> 00:00:44.300
I decided that, for your birthday, I would make you this small little game.

00:00:44.300 --> 00:00:48.400
I had very little time to work on this (I started on June 3rd I believe)

00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:51.620
so it is far from perfect, but I hope you can still enjoy it.

00:00:51.620 --> 00:00:53.880
Happy (late) birthday and, once again,

00:00:53.880 --> 00:00:55.200
Thank you for everything!

00:00:55.200 --> 00:00:58.020
Sincerely, Luis (Lixian)

00:00:58.020 --> 00:01:00.820
Disclaimer: I did not make any of the pretty assets.

00:01:01.260 --> 00:01:02.280
So,

00:01:02.700 --> 00:01:08.680
number one, I'm freaking honored that anyone would make a game for me

00:01:08.680 --> 00:01:09.720
Uhh...

